        <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 3rem; font-weight: 300; color: #20252A;">
            St. Martin's High School provides an inspiring, safe, and technologically advanced campus environment engineered to cultivate academic concentration, physical fitness, and holistic student development.
        </p>

        <div class="row g-3 mb-5">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="p-4 bg-white h-100 border-start" style="border-left: 3px solid #C5A45A !important;">
