                    <h4 class="mt-2 mb-2" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; color: #071A2B;">Purposeful Spaces</h4>
                    <p class="mb-0" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #6c757d;">Every learning space is planned to support concentration, participation, creativity, and student development.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="p-4 bg-white h-100 border-start" style="border-left: 3px solid #C5A45A !important;">
                    <small class="text-uppercase" style="letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #C5A45A; font-weight: 600;">02</small>
                    <h4 class="mt-2 mb-2" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; color: #071A2B;">Holistic Development</h4>
                    <p class="mb-0" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #6c757d;">The campus environment supports academic growth alongside practical, creative, social, and personal development.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="p-4 bg-white h-100 border-start" style="border-left: 3px solid #C5A45A !important;">
                    <small class="text-uppercase" style="letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #C5A45A; font-weight: 600;">03</small>
                    <h4 class="mt-2 mb-2" style="font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; color: #071A2B;">Student Experience</h4>
                    <p class="mb-0" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #6c757d;">A welcoming and organised campus gives students an environment in which they can learn, explore, and grow.</p>
